{
  "scene_id": "scene.086_sanctuary_to_storm",
  "description": "The crystalline formations surrounding Kavurn's Echo sang with the first light of dawn, each facet catching and fracturing the rays into prismatic cascades that danced across the sanctuary's entrance.",
  "entities": [
